/4/40/Reeling_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Reeling_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/40/Reeling_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Reeling_(Condition)\" title=\"Reeling (Condition)\">Reeling</a> for 2 turns.</dd></dl>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scale_Mail_Mould\" title=\"Scale Mail Mould\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Scale_Mould_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Scale_Mould_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/11/Scale_Mould_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-Scale_Mould_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/11/Scale_Mould_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Scale_Mould_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Scale_Mould_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Scale_Mould_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/11/Scale_Mould_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Scale_Mail_Mould\" title=\"Scale Mail Mould\">Scale Mail Mould</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\" style=\"width: 50px; height: 50px; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; overflow: hidden;\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Adamantine_Splint_Armour\" title=\"Adamantine Splint Armour\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/20/Adamantine_Splint_Mail_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Adamantine_Splint_Mail_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/20/Adamantine_Splint_Mail_Unfaded_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/20/Adamantine_Splint_Mail_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Adamantine_Splint_Mail_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/20/Adamantine_Splint_Mail_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><br><a href=\"/wiki/Adamantine_Splint_Armour\" title=\"Adamantine Splint Armour\"> <span style=\"color: #D1017B ;\">Adamantine Splint Armour</span> </a>\n</td>\n<td>18\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Armour\" title=\"Armour\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dd/Armour_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/dd/Armour_Icon.png/38px-Armour_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/dd/Armour_Icon.png/50px-Armour_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Armour\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dd/Armour_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/dd/Armour_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Armour\" title=\"Armour\">Armour</a>&nbsp;(<a href=\"/wiki/Heavy_Armour\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Heavy Armour\">Heavy Armor</a>)\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li>Attackers can't land <a href=\"/wiki/Critical_Hit\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Critical Hit\">Critical Hits</a> on the wearer.</li></ul>\n<dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Magical_Plate_(-2)\" title=\"Magical Plate (-2)\">Magical Plate</a></dt><dd>All incoming damage is reduced by 2.</dd></dl>\n<dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Intense_Adamantine_Backlash\" title=\"Intense Adamantine Backlash\">Intense Adamantine Backlash</a></dt><dd>When a melee attack hits you, the Attacker is sent <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Reeling_(Condition)\" title=\"Reeling (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/40/Reeling_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Reeling_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/40/Reeling_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Reeling_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/40/Reeling_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Reeling_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Reeling\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/40/Reeling_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Reeling_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/40/Reeling_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Reeling_(Condition)\" title=\"Reeling (Condition)\">Reeling</a> for 3 turns.</dd></dl>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Splint_Mould\" title=\"Splint Mould\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/81/Splint_Mould_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Splint_Mould_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/81/Splint_Mould_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-Splint_Mould_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/81/Splint_Mould_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Splint_Mould_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/81/Splint_Mould_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Splint_Mould_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/81/Splint_Mould_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Splint_Mould\" title=\"Splint Mould\">Splint Mould</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Shields\">Shields</span></h3>\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r243549\">\n<table class=\"wikitable defaultleft col1center sortable\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:150px\">Name\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:10px\">AC\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:220px\">Slot\n</th>\n<th>Effect\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:125px\">Mould\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\" style=\"width: 50px; height: 50px; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; overflow: hidden;\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Adamantine_Shield\" title=\"Adamantine Shield\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f1/Adamantine_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Adamantine_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/f1/Adamantine_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f1/Adamantine_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Adamantine_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f1/Adamantine_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><br><a href=\"/wiki/Adamantine_Shield\" title=\"Adamantine Shield\"> <span style=\"color: #01BFFF ;\">Adamantine Shield</span> </a>\n</td>\n<td>+2\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Off-Hand_Melee\" title=\"Off-Hand Melee\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Off-Hand_Melee_Weapon_Icon.png/25px-Off-Hand_Melee_Weapon_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Off-Hand_Melee_Weapon_Icon.png/38px-Off-Hand_Melee_Weapon_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Off-Hand_Melee_Weapon_Icon.png/50px-Off-Hand_Melee_Weapon_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Off-Hand Melee\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Off-Hand_Melee_Weapon_Icon.png/25px-Off-Hand_Melee_Weapon_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Off-Hand_Melee_Weapon_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Off-Hand_Melee\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Off-Hand Melee\">Off-Hand Melee</a>&nbsp;(<a href=\"/wiki/Shields\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Shields\">Shield</a>)\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li>Attackers can't land <a href=\"/wiki/Critical_hit\" title=\"Critical hit\">critical hits</a> on the wearer.</li></ul>\n<dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shield_Blow\" title=\"Shield Blow\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/42/Shield_Bash_Icon.webp/40px-Shield_Bash_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/42/Shield_Bash_Icon.webp/60px-Shield_Bash_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/42/Shield_Bash_Icon.webp/80px-Shield_Bash_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shield Blow\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/42/Shield_Bash_Icon.webp/40px-Shield_Bash_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/42/Shield_Bash_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shield_Blow\" title=\"Shield Blow\">Shield Blow</a> (<span aria-label=\"Reaction\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/23px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/35px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/46px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Reaction\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/23px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>When a foe hits you with a melee attack, you can use your reaction to knock it <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon-wrapper\" style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-width: 25px; height: 25px;\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Prone_(Condition)\" title=\"Prone (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Prone\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span><span class=\"bg3wiki-after-icon\"></span></span></span>&nbsp;<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-text\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/Prone_(Condition)\" title=\"Prone (Condition)\">Prone</a></span>, unless they succeed a <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span><span class=\"bg3wiki-after-icon\"></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Strength</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving throw\">saving throw</a>. </dd>\n</dl>\n<dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Adamantine_Shield_(passive_feature)\" title=\"Adamantine Shield (passive feature)\">Adamantine Shield</a></dt><dd>When a melee attack misses you, the attacker is sent <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Reeling_(Condition)\" title=\"Reeling (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/40/Reeling_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Reeling_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/40/Reeling_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Reeling_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/40/Reeling_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Reeling_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Reeling\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/40/Reeling_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Reeling_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/40/Reeling_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Reeling_(Condition)\" title=\"Reeling (Condition)\">Reeling</a> for 2 turns.</dd></dl>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shield_Mould\" title=\"Shield Mould\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8b/Shield_Mould_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Shield_Mould_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8b/Shield_Mould_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-Shield_Mould_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8b/Shield_Mould_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Shield_Mould_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8b/Shield_Mould_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Shield_Mould_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8b/Shield_Mould_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shield_Mo